    "title": "Military talks to finalize pilot zones for Israeli withdrawal in southern Lebanon",
    "description": "BEIRUT: Lebanese and Israeli military officials are set to meet virtually on Friday under US sponsorship to finalize a list of pilot zones, agree on a timetable for Israel’s withdrawal from them and expand the Lebanese Army’s deployment in southern Lebanon. The technical talks follow the conclusion on Wednesday of the latest round of Lebanese-Israeli negotiations in Rome,",
